              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gal 4:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imba, webo O musundi uutazyali, Talika kwiimba akuuma nguluulu, webo otatumbuki. Nkaambo bana banabutema mbanji kwiinda bana bayooyo uukwetwe, mbwaamba Jehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komezya kuntu nkuukede, amasani aatente lyacikalilo cako andandamikwe. Utayoowi kulampya intambo zyako akuyumya inkankamino zyako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo unooya bulimwaisya koonse koonse kululyo akulumwensi, nkabela lunyungu lwako luyoovuba nyika yabamasi akukala muminzi iibulide bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Utayoowi pe, nkaambo tokooyoofwa insoni. Utakankami, nkaambo tokooyoofwisigwa bweeme. Uyooluba insoni yabwanike bwako, akusampaulwa kwabumukamufu bwako tokooyookuyeeya limbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.41.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 41:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
